/Title (It gives us a great sense of pleasure to present the report of the project undertaken during B.Tech. second year. We owe special debt of gratitude to Dr. CHANDAN CHOUBEY  \(project guide \), Associate Professor, Department of Electrical and Electronics Engineering, School of Engineering, IILM University, Greater Noida for his constant support and guidance throughout the course of our work. His sincerity, thoroughness and perseverance have been a constant source of inspiration for us.)
